[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891642133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106589#issuecomment-2891642133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106589","id":2891642133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sWvUV","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T16:37:35Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T16:37:35Z","body":"Even if the debug output isn't getting piped anywhere, there could be overhead from running all the debug checks on the driver side. We should probably do a performance comparison between the driver profile method and this PR to see if there are any performance regressions.\r\n\r\nI know it's the Compatibility renderer, but many of us have good reasons to use it as the main renderer instead of a fallback. And GL draw call overhead is bad enough as it is without debug checks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891642133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891703262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106589#issuecomment-2891703262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106589","id":2891703262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sW-Pe","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T17:00:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T17:00:08Z","body":"> Even if the debug output isn't getting piped anywhere, there could be overhead from running all the debug checks on the driver side. We should probably do a performance comparison between the driver profile method and this PR to see if there are any performance regressions.\r\n\r\nSure, that's why it's optional.\r\nThe point here is not performance (versus the driver), it's to avoid the regressions involved with trying to access the driver.\r\n\r\nEssentially when I started porting the driver access code to 3.x, @akien-mga was pretty skeptical as afaik it's turned out to be a minefield for regressions. Hence why I'm keen to lead with the debug logging approach on 3.x. We already have users switching on `verbose_logging` to try and make releases in 3.x, so this is clearly a problem that needs solving, and I'm just aiming to make it more efficient.\r\n\r\nFor 4.x, this PR is just a forward port as a courtesy. It's up to you guys whether you want to struggle with the driver access approach or try out this simpler version.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891703262/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891732402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106589#issuecomment-2891732402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106589","id":2891732402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sXFWy","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T17:11:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T17:11:34Z","body":"To be clear, I'm also not a fan of the driver profile approach because it's basically polluting the user's machine with lots of different app profiles. I also wasn't aware that folks were shipping with the debug logging workaround, so if this works for devs already, I think that's pretty cool.\r\n\r\nIt's just kind of a weird way to tackle the problem, even if we don't have much choice. So I think it's worth looking to see if this method could cause regressions as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891732402/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2966259621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106589#issuecomment-2966259621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106589","id":2966259621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wzYel","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T11:27:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T11:27:44Z","body":"Finally got some feedback in 3.x which confirms the PR works as intended, so moving this back out of draft.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106556#issuecomment-2966235134\r\n\r\nIt may end up being we get to test this on 3.x first, but obviously it would get more testing with 4.x users.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2966259621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2966403085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106589#issuecomment-2966403085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106589","id":2966403085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wz7gN","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","ty